Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the year 2036,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the world is ruled by SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.93,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an oppressive, totalitarian society— a dystopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,People were robbed of their freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and they live like zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who disobeyed was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.95,0:02:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was part of the resistance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,fighting to free the world from SERN's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To change this forsaken world...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...I entered the time machine my father left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everything you wrote on @channel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, most of it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But SERN is a research organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,not a ruling body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,On the net, I told John Titor that many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are KuriGohan and Kamehameha{Kamehameha, lit. Turtle Destruction/Devastation Wave}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Titor identified himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so it wouldn't be fair if I didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll identify myself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was using the name Hououin Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN succeeded in developing a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they were the only ones able to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,interfere with the fourth dimension, time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,they remade the world map, so to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and Makise Kurisu is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,who contributed the most to the time machine's development.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hailed as the mother of the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked with SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I work with people who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,perform human experiments?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happened in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you disliked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the future me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro is a famous terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrorist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A terrorist who fought SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're both...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...dead in the year 2036.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to say something crazy like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then just return to the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the past to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To 1975...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,1975?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN succeeded in developing a time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,due to the one created in Akihabara in 2010.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN used a communication monitoring system
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to gather all the information they could on time machines from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the first D-Mail you sent tripped the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The message I sent in front of Radio Kaikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we delete the message from SERN's database,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the future will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go to the Beta worldline, where SERN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,never successfully created a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that save Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we should start hacking SERN's database immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the IBN 5100 for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My task was to go to 1975,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,find an IBN 5100,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and get it to Okabe Rintaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but I stayed too long to look for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've left earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Run when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of an operation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to end the Organization's schemes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a level 17 top secret mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,so stay away from this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:06:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happens in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but right now, I'm a lab mem just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the time machine broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it from when it crashed into the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an error in calculating the coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so it appeared there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I arrived, it wasn't broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then when?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd say that thunderstorm we had...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It might've been hit by lightning or flooded...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I stopped you then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the time leap machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only use it to go back 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get back to that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kurisu and Suzu are with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii said we should have a party to celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the time machine's completion after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru and I went shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I said we were done for the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to talk about something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have the party another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't do anything dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the trains stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to repair the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,First, go back to five hours ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,when the time leap machine was completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,From there, go back 48 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to 2:00 PM on the 11th.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most time we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish the time machine during those two days,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't, I'll redo those two days as many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mission to save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather all the lab mems right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk to them about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Future tech is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be photoshopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Amane, you can't do it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's the one who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can fix a time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,from 2036 using today's technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, try to do it in two days, Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can, I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher, I want to have a day long date with Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll make it happen somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're serious? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fix it, in addition to the IBN 5100,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,get me a cel{http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cel} from the legendary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,1975 magical girl anime, {\i1}Ragical Girl Omit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I help too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you need to finish the time leap machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, aren't you all forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We should look for Suzu's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You got in the time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,because you had a job to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but you also wanted to see your dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mayushii wants to help you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad's name was Barrel Titor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That was his code name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know his real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's "Amane" from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,From my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My only clue is this little badge he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad is in 2010's Akihabara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mayushii will be the investigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri... is a good girl, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but looking at it, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kind of like the PhoneWave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's a chance you'll be able to fix it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if your dad's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew that we were in Akiba in 2010, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never heard from him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything was in his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was researching a time machine separately from SERN...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to carry on his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but if I can fix the time machine, it's possible that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll find your dad before you get back from 1975.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep this a secret from Okarin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and try to get me that cel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty straightforward way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be the Future Gadget Laboratory,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you don't have a more futuristic way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's as convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Gadget #2, alt. edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,version 2.67.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,AKA the Bamboo Copter Camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a CCD camera on the lower body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we use this for an aerial search?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The camera spins too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so the video you receive revolves at a high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at version 2.67, and that still isn't fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first one we’ve made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru came up with the name, along with the version.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no real meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still hard at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The divergence meter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it, so I think you should have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If this number goes above 1%, the future will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With your Reading Steiner,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the only one who will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I give you that before I died in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I never met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a founding member of the resistance I was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I founded the resistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even save Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I kept on living
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,like a stupid little kid in a fantasy world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:16:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an honest, brave desire to save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.81,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonuvabitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So you speak Japanese, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you look into it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he speaks Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remember, contact me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this’ll be created in the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't exist now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's fate that I never meet my dad, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to give up on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to prioritize saving Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you're a lab mem and a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help you if I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you already giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't yell at me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There was a kidnapping yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for the criminal. He wore a badge like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Mayushii's idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think everyone might go, "Huh?" when they see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Big Victory with Mayushii's Pamphlets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A kidnapping is pushing it, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the police start looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, ask me about these operations first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When I went to buy lunch, I overheard the clerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Amane's dad might be a kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were awesome, you would've brought me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,an ice-cold zero-calorie cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we fix the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked this whole time, but that's still amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he looks unhealthy and kind of dim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't judge him by his looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've changed my mind about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can help me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:20:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in the steaming-hot confines of the time machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we can forget our shame and take off our clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru and Suzu look good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Together? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know how to say it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri was just saying something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the time machine gets fixed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Suzu when she rides it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If it could fit two people, I could go with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hold Suzu's hand really tight, and I'd say,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's okay! Mayushii's with you, so it's okay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm saying this because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever have the chance to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's an exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first came here, I didn't know anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though this era is much more peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow, to me, it was really scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I have lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy that I could come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I could spend time with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I had the chance to be a lab mem, if only for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I had the chance to spend time with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it a free world, like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad scientist so cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy from this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,About that pin badge from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You found her father?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:21:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
